OL,3,AVictims 'grossly failed' by sex
OL,4,Aoffender bail decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on BBC Radio 4's Today, Andrea
OL,7,FSimon said the case showed that "the
OL,8,Fjustice system did not centre victims"
OL,9,Fand called for a multi-agency review.
OL,11,FA government spokesperson said the law
OL,12,Fwas clear that bail "should only be
OL,13,Fused where necessary and proportionate,
OL,14,Fincluding to protect victims".
